<title>USA: GOLF-FINAL SCORES AT BUICK CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>GOLF-FINAL SCORES AT BUICK CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>HARRISON, New York 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leaders after the</p>
<p>final round of the $1.5 million Buick Classic golf tournament</p>
<p>at Westchester Country Club on Sunday (U.S. unless stated):</p>
<p>268 Ernie Els (South Africa) 64 68 67 69</p>
<p>270 Jeff Maggert 67 69 66 68</p>
<p>274 Jim Furyk 67 68 69 70, Robert Damron 71 66 68 69</p>
<p>275 Jim Carter 69 70 71 65</p>
<p>277 Bob Estes 71 67 71 68, Clarence Rose 69 69 70 69, Stewart</p>
<p>Cink 73 68 66 70</p>
<p>278 Brad Fabel 69 67 74 68, Peter Jordan 69 68 69 72</p>
<p>279 Brad Faxon 66 74 70 69</p>
<p>281 Frank Nobilo (New Zealand) 70 69 77 65, David Frost</p>
<p>(South Africa 78 67 66 70, Vijay Singh (Fiji) 67 73 69 72,</p>
<p>Mike Reid 70 69 68 74, Billy Andrade 73 71 64 73</p>
<p>282 Stuart Appleby (Australia) 70 73 69 70, Lee Janzen 70 72</p>
<p>71 69, Nolan Henke 72 68 70 72, Chris Perry 71 72 67 72</p>
<p>Other international players</p>
<p>283 Rafael Alarcon (Mexico) 69 69 73 72</p>
<p>285 Craig Parry (Australia) 70 73 73 69</p>
<p>286 Fulton Allem (South Africa) 72 72 71 71</p>
<p>287 Bradley Hughes (Australia) 70 72 71 74, Steve Elkington</p>
<p>(Australia) 74 70 70 73</p>
<p>289 Gabriel Hjertstedt (Sweden) 73 71 75 70</p>
<p>298 Phil Tataurangi (New Zealand) 74 71 77 76</p>
